// RUN: fe2o3-mir-ssa-lit %s
// EXPECT: PASS
// CHECK: event 0 use v0=d0
// CHECK: event 1 use v0=d0
// CHECK: event 2 def v0=d1
// CHECK: event 3 use v0=d1
// RHS projected Move precedes the destination holder use. The independent
// typed partial-state certificate owns leaf removal and reinitialization.

entry b0
variables v0
entry-def v0
block b0
use v0
use v0
def v0
use v0
